        "q1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is TapGlow, exactly?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A CNC-machined metal click toy, designed to be carried, not stored. It's a precision object for restless hands, at your desk, in transit, or mid-thought.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it actually useful, or just satisfying?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Both. The click gives restless hands somewhere to go, so your attention can stay where you put it. Many people use it during calls, deep work, or study sessions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's it made from?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Solid aircraft-grade aluminum, precision-milled and finished by hand. No plastic housing, no glued parts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will the click wear out?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No. The magnetic mechanism is rated for hundreds of thousands of clicks, built to outlast the desk it sits on.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
